 we will rinse the crystals off of the paper with our alcohol now we want to dissolve our aspirin and the alcohol so that we can recrystallize recrystallizing will allow us to get larger crystals of the acetylsalicylic acid now we're going to add 60 milliliters of warm water see it gets cloudy there's actually a little bit of crystallization it's occurring we want to stir that and now we get to wait again we need to give this time for the crystals to form so we're going to put it back in our ice water mix in a way of filter paper all right the filter paper weighs 0.35 4 grams so make sure you record that number I'll place my weighed filter paper in the funnel and set up my filtering apparatus again now we can turn on our aspirator and filter next we want to take out our filter paper with the aspirin on it and set it on a watch glass now we have to set it aside and let it air dry now we want to weigh our dried filter paper and aspirin sample this is what one of the crystals that close looks like you",
